<title>USA: Missouri jobless rate at 4.8 pct in February.</title>
<headline>Missouri jobless rate at 4.8 pct in February.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Missouri's unemployment rate decreased slightly to 4.8 percent in February from 5.1 percent in January, the state's department of labor and industrial relations reported Wednesday.</p>
<p>The department estimated the number of jobless workers at 137,400 last month, down by 6,100 from January. The state's February 1996 unemployment rate was 4.9 percent.</p>
<p>((--Karen Pierog, 312-408-8647))</p>
